※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 5005 LANG_STMT_VALUE_DISCARDED

※ The last statement of a body is the body's result -- but a body with no
※ result has nowhere for the value to go, so the last statement of one is as
※ much a discarded value as any other statement.
let count: u8 = 7u8

@[constructor]
fn prepare():
    count

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    0u6
